item.description:
The Beginning So, the real estate auto-pricing is actually a project. And the story of this project is a long one. I remember taking on this project around May last year, then stumbling through it for a while, and finally giving up because the technical skills weren&rsquo;t up to par (definitely not recommending this kind of academic spirit!).
But this matter wasn&rsquo;t that simple&hellip;
Soon, around June, we&rsquo;ll have to present the results.
